/* Văn phòng kế toán số: one visual language for the portal and agents 1 to 3 (agent 4 chat uses it too).
   Source of truth is design/platform-theme.css; design/sync.py copies it into each agent's static folder.
   Sections: 1 fonts, 2 tokens, 3 shared rules, 4 Agent 1, 5 Agent 2, 6 Agent 3, 7 inside the portal frame. */

